# Photobooks overview

Local-first photobook editor (Vite + React 19 + TypeScript + pnpm).

- Repository language: **English** (code, comments, commits, OpenSpec artifacts, CI).
- Russian only in chat and `.local_dev/` — never commit `.local_dev/`.
- Toolchain: Node 22 (`.nvmrc`), pnpm 10 (`packageManager`).
- Spec-driven workflow via OpenSpec (`openspec/`, `/opsx-*` commands).
- Per-change OpenSpec mandates: `openspec/config.yaml` only (do not duplicate here).
